3. Commercial licensing
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Cultivados en Gracia y Verdad may grant a commercial license for the
Bible text, public tooling, or both, by written agreement. The public
licenses do not limit that authority.

Request a commercial license by opening an issue titled
“Commercial license” or by written agreement through the repository
owner.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
4. Reverse-alignment engine and database
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The reverse-alignment engine and its working database are private.
They are not published in this repository and are not licensed here.

Published book alignment files under `releases/` are release artifacts
of the Bible text. They follow section 1.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
5. Third-party sources
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Files under `source/` keep their upstream licenses. See `NOTICE.md`.
This LICENSE does not relicense those works.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
6. Names
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

“La Biblia Fiel” and “LBF” name only the wording published by
Cultivados en Gracia y Verdad in this repository. They are not
licensed for use on adapted, competing, or independently altered texts.

